<title>UK: AHB sets 500 million mark FRN due December 2002.</title>
<headline>AHB sets 500 million mark FRN due December 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    06.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    06.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  100.15    FULL FEES   0.15</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> LISTING    FRANKFURT DENOMS (K) 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.10</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
